abstract: >-
  A reviewer-oriented mathematical proof-transport certificate cartridge. The
  initial release contains source-pinned computational audits for cut-scalar and
  native Euler foundations and for native logarithm, finite arithmetic,
  prime-factorization identities, and Dirichlet-zeta obligations on the
  half-plane Re(s) > 1. Later completed-Weil and RH claims remain outside the
  certified scope.
